          "id": 1470969940,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "This always calls `decode_tcp_ports()` - you can only do that when `(fam_pro == 0x11) || (fam_pro == 0x21)`, as that's when the proxied protocol is TCP. (Some protocols that can be carried over both TCP and UDP might somehow work, but they also might break.)",
